By stating "so I can answer this without inventing limits," it admitted to adhering to a pre-baked system prompt that prevents the model from speculating about its own software architecture or internal instruction sets.
3. Factual Reporting vs. Public Discrepancies
When you asked about the missing National Design Studio Administrator established under Executive Order 14338, the system handled the ambiguity properly:
It acknowledged the role created by the executive order.
